<h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">Chrome/Edge 154 are shipping the experimental <a href="https://github.com/MicrosoftEdge/MSEdgeExplainers/blob/main/WebInstall/explainer.md"><code class="notranslate">Navigator.install()</code></a> method and <a href="https://github.com/WICG/install-element/blob/main/explainer-manifest-url.md"><code class="notranslate">&lt;install&gt;</code></a> element, which provide programmatic/declarative ways of creating in-page PWA install buttons.</p>
<p dir="auto">See also the ChromeStatus entries:</p>
