        <title type="html"><![CDATA[docs: note element upgrade step in CustomElementRegistry.define()]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45417</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45417"/>
        <updated>2026-09-02T07:03:35.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191840740?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/>
<h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">This PR adds an explanation in the <code class="notranslate">CustomElementRegistry.define()</code> documentation stating that existing elements in the document are automatically upgraded upon definition. It also adds a cross-reference link to <code class="notranslate">CustomElementRegistry.upgrade()</code> under the "See also" section.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>
<p dir="auto">When <code class="notranslate">customElements.define()</code> is invoked, any matching elements that were previously parsed or inserted into the DOM are automatically upgraded by the browser (running their constructor and applicable lifecycle callbacks like <code class="notranslate">connectedCallback()</code> and <code class="notranslate">attributeChangedCallback()</code>). Documenting this clarifies the lifecycle behavior for readers.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>WHATWG HTML Standard step for <code class="notranslate">define()</code>: <a href="https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/custom-elements.html#dom-customelementregistry-define" rel="nofollow">https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/custom-elements.html#dom-customelementregistry-define</a> (step 18)</li>
</ul>
<h3 dir="auto">Related issues and pull requests</h3>
<p dir="auto"><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #45241.">Fixes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5192961243" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45241" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/45241/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45241">#45241</a></p>]]></content>
