<h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">From Chrome 150 onwards, the <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/zoom" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">zoom</code></a> CSS property is animatable; see <a href="https://chromestatus.com/feature/5183671737909248" rel="nofollow">https://chromestatus.com/feature/5183671737909248</a>. It was always animatable in Firefox.</p>
<p dir="auto">The <a href="https://drafts.csswg.org/css-viewport/#zoom-property" rel="nofollow">spec</a> has been updated so that <code class="notranslate">zoom</code> is now marked as animated by computed value type.</p>
<p dir="auto">This PR adds animation details to the <code class="notranslate">zoom</code> property page; I also took this opportunity to generally improve the page and make it follow the template.</p>

